{
  "slug": "claude-transcribe",
  "name": "Claude Transcribe",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Transcribe video and audio from URLs (YouTube, X/Twitter, TikTok, Vimeo, podcasts) or local media files into plain-text transcripts using yt-dlp + OpenAI Whisper. Auto-triggers when you ask Claude to research, transcribe, summarise, or take notes on a video. Runs entirely on-device — no audio is uploaded anywhere. Browser cookies are passed to yt-dlp automatically so age-gated and members-only sources work for signed-in users.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install claude-transcribe@claude-community` from `alicicek/claude-transcribe`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that turns any video or audio — a YouTube link, an X / TikTok / Vimeo URL, a podcast, or a local media file — into a plain-text transcript that Claude can read and reason about.",
